//// The `onze-bundler` package — module-tree root.
////
//// The client bundle — module graph, refusals, chunks, the manifest
//// the BEAM server reads on every render, and the generated hydration entry.
////
//// A skeleton created by front 95 (`specs/1.0.10-beta/06-onze/modules.md`
//// § The cut): an empty `pub` surface and one inline test, so the member is a
//// row of `zig build test-libs` from the first commit. Owner: front 68.

test "onze-bundler: the member compiles and runs on its rows" {
    assert "onze-bundler".length() == 12;
}
